      <AppProse>

<p><em>Last reviewed April 2026.</em></p>

<h1>Recast Alternatives: Top Competing Tools for 2026</h1>

<p>Teams compare Recast alternatives when they need a different balance of Bayesian MMM, incrementality testing, attribution, budget optimization, and ecommerce reporting. Recast is a strong fit for rigorous MMM, but not every team needs that level of statistical modeling.</p>

<h2>Quick Comparison</h2>

<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Name</th><th>Best for</th><th>Pricing tier</th><th>Link</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Measured</td><td>Incrementality testing and test-calibrated MMM</td><td>Enterprise</td><td><a href="/measured">View</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Keen</td><td>Marketing investment optimization</td><td>Enterprise</td><td><a href="/keen">View</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Rockerbox</td><td>Attribution and measurement workflow</td><td>Custom</td><td>No MPT page yet</td></tr>
